[tests]
TestMergeUpgradeInstallsGuardedRoleSurfaces = "Run the real merge handler on all nine unguarded role addresses; assert guarded bytes, code size and hash, exact surface records, nonzero balances, nonces and three storage slots per address; a second handler run leaves every KV store byte-identical; the registered upgrade completes at the merge height and a completed-plan replay changes nothing"
